# data/cache is 151 MB of training tensors and model weights (n2n_triplets.npz,
# n2n_model.pt); data/globaltime is a landmark harvest. Both are outputs, not
# sources, and both would push the repository past what GitHub is comfortable
# serving for a gallery.
